WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Work measures energy transferred along displacement; power measures how quickly that transfer occurs.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
100 N aligned over 20 m gives 2,000 J; completing it in 10 s means 200 W average power.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Unit check

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A block diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of legal roadworthiness.

